script = ExtResource("1_i518i")
ID = "basic_skillpoints"
title = "Skillpoints"
text = "Skillpoints can be used to unlock upgrades in the upgrade-shop.
They are earned by exploring the missions. Even if you cannot finish a run succesfully, you might earn some points. F.e. by finishing a part of the mission, exploring a number of roooms, defeating a though opponent,... "
